{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-56429","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-64266","text":"RuneFort Interactive Layer — Build Order"}]},{"id":"blk-56430","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-64267","text":"Overview"}]},{"id":"blk-56431","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64268","text":"Six prompts that transform RuneFort from a static fort visualizer into an interactive playground with BYOK chat, MCP tool connections, token flow animations, repo import, and workspace management."}]},{"id":"blk-56432","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-64269","text":"Dependency Graph"}]},{"id":"blk-56433","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"RFORT-1 (BYOK) ──────┐\n                      ├── RFORT-3 (Chat) ── RFORT-4 (Token Flows)\nRFORT-2 (MCP) ───────┘\nRFORT-5 (Repo Import) ── standalone, uses fort generator\nRFORT-6 (Workspaces) ── standalone, uses auth + supabase"},{"id":"blk-56434","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-64270","text":"Recommended Session Plan"}]},{"id":"blk-56435","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-64271","text":"Session A: Foundation (RFORT-1 + RFORT-2)"}]},{"id":"blk-56436","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64272","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-64273","text":": \"Build RFORT-1 and RFORT-2. Read "},{"id":"spn-64274","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-1_BYOK.md"},{"id":"spn-64275","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-64276","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-2_MCP.md"},{"id":"spn-64277","text":" for full specs. These are the foundation — BYOK key storage and MCP proxy/client. Port patterns from "},{"id":"spn-64278","marks":["code"],"text":"bendscript.com/src/lib/play/"},{"id":"spn-64279","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-64280","marks":["code"],"text":"bendscript.com/src/routes/api/play/mcp-proxy/"},{"id":"spn-64281","text":". Verify: API key modal opens, key persists in localStorage, MCP proxy forwards to graphonomous-mcp.fly.dev, tool discovery returns tools.\""}]},{"id":"blk-56437","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-64282","text":"Session B: Chat (RFORT-3)"}]},{"id":"blk-56438","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64283","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-64284","text":": \"Build RFORT-3. Read "},{"id":"spn-64285","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-3_CHAT.md"},{"id":"spn-64286","text":" for full spec. Add the chat panel with tool-use loop. The chat should use the BYOK OpenRouter key (from RFORT-1), call MCP tools via the proxy (from RFORT-2), and execute built-in fort navigation tools that zoom/navigate the fort view. Verify: chat sends messages via OpenRouter, tool calls work (both MCP and built-in), fort navigation tools zoom the view.\""}]},{"id":"blk-56439","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-64287","text":"Session C: Token Flows (RFORT-4)"}]},{"id":"blk-56440","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64288","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-64289","text":": \"Build RFORT-4. Read "},{"id":"spn-64290","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-4_TOKENFLOWS.md"},{"id":"spn-64291","text":" for full spec. Add animated particles on Svelte Flow edges representing token throughput. Include a benchmark simulation mode that cascades flows through PULSE phases. Verify: particles animate along edges, speed/color respond to metrics, simulation runs through all phases.\""}]},{"id":"blk-56441","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-64292","text":"Session D: Repo Import (RFORT-5)"}]},{"id":"blk-56442","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64293","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-64294","text":": \"Build RFORT-5. Read "},{"id":"spn-64295","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-5_REPO_IMPORT.md"},{"id":"spn-64296","text":" for full spec. Add GitHub repo import that converts repository structure into a fort. Directories → rooms, files → tiles, package manifests → gates. Verify: paste a GitHub URL, import generates a navigable fort, zoom works on imported fort.\""}]},{"id":"blk-56443","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-64297","text":"Session E: Workspaces (RFORT-6)"}]},{"id":"blk-56444","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64298","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-64299","text":": \"Build RFORT-6. Read "},{"id":"spn-64300","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-6_WORKSPACES.md"},{"id":"spn-64301","text":" for full spec. Add workspace switching tied to amp.workspaces. Each workspace shows its own district of saved forts. Verify: workspace dropdown shows user's workspaces, switching reloads forts, demo mode works without auth.\""}]},{"id":"blk-56445","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-64302","text":"Context for All Sessions"}]},{"id":"blk-56446","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-56448","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64303","marks":["bold"],"text":"Framework"},{"id":"spn-64304","text":": SvelteKit 2.x + Svelte 5 (runes: "},{"id":"spn-64305","marks":["code"],"text":"$state"},{"id":"spn-64306","text":", "},{"id":"spn-64307","marks":["code"],"text":"$props"},{"id":"spn-64308","text":", "},{"id":"spn-64309","marks":["code"],"text":"$effect"},{"id":"spn-64310","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-56447","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-56450","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64311","marks":["bold"],"text":"Flow lib"},{"id":"spn-64312","text":": "},{"id":"spn-64313","marks":["code"],"text":"@xyflow/svelte"},{"id":"spn-64314","text":" v1.5.0"}]}],"id":"blk-56449","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-56452","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64315","marks":["bold"],"text":"Style"},{"id":"spn-64316","text":": Dark theme, zinc-900 bg, amber-400 accents"}]}],"id":"blk-56451","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-56454","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64317","marks":["bold"],"text":"SSR"},{"id":"spn-64318","text":": Disabled on "},{"id":"spn-64319","marks":["code"],"text":"/app"},{"id":"spn-64320","text":" route ("},{"id":"spn-64321","marks":["code"],"text":"export const ssr = false"},{"id":"spn-64322","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-56453","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-56456","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64323","marks":["bold"],"text":"Supabase"},{"id":"spn-64324","text":": Lazy client via "},{"id":"spn-64325","marks":["code"],"text":"getSupabase()"},{"id":"spn-64326","text":" (returns null during SSR)"}]}],"id":"blk-56455","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-56458","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64327","marks":["bold"],"text":"Existing code"},{"id":"spn-64328","text":": Marketing site + 5-level fort editor already built (see "},{"id":"spn-64329","marks":["code"],"text":"src/"},{"id":"spn-64330","text":" tree)"}]}],"id":"blk-56457","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-56460","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64331","marks":["bold"],"text":"BendScript reference"},{"id":"spn-64332","text":": The "},{"id":"spn-64333","marks":["code"],"text":"/play"},{"id":"spn-64334","text":" implementation in "},{"id":"spn-64335","marks":["code"],"text":"bendscript.com/"},{"id":"spn-64336","text":" is the proven pattern to port from"}]}],"id":"blk-56459","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaieraiax2tc5oqssnqme624nkwrckzidezd2le7vzp7sk5xybsuyyyvqq","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}